    "Budget approval never grants OBSERVE, EXPERIMENT, MODIFY or ACT authority.",
    "The USD 10/day paid model/API ceiling remains finite, reservation-gated, provider-gated, idempotent and kill-switch controlled.",
    "Paid model/API execution requires a durable reservation before invocation.",
    "GitHub-hosted workload is not admitted or blocked by daily job-start quotas in the cost governor.",
    "Non-paid reporting, Hunter, scheduler, heartbeat, notification, software-factory and feedback workflows use workload_control/WORKLOAD_POLICY.json and independent concurrency lanes.",
    "Paid-workflow wrappers may retain a bounded GitHub-job reservation only for timeout/accounting compatibility; GitHub job counts and minutes are not financial hard-stop fields.",
    "Active paid reservations count against financial ceilings until committed, cancelled or expired.",
    "Idempotency keys suppress duplicate paid spend and collisions fail closed.",
    "Retry groups cannot reset attempt numbers to bypass paid retry ceilings.",
    "A paid reservation overage triggers a hard stop that blocks subsequent paid model/API preflight.",
    "Paid hard stops and the spend kill switch do not block essential reporting or other non-paid workload lanes.",
    "The shared paid concurrency group serializes workflows that can mutate paid cost state so artifact-backed accounting cannot race.",
    "Only sanitized IDs, hashes, numeric usage and evidence references may be persisted while BLK-005 is open."
